@RBooking.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5293

### Get all users
GET {{RBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new user
POST {{RBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alexandru",
  "lastName": "Popa",
  "email": "alex.popa@example.com"
}

###
